WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.441 line:85%
I dug into the arctic ground of Mars, and I found ice!

2
00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:06.806 line:85%
I'm Phoenix.

3
00:00:06.896 --> 00:00:13.887 line:85%
On May 25, 2008, I landed on the arctic plains near Mars' North Pole.

4
00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:18.035 line:85%
Every day, I used my robotic arm to dig up soil.

5
00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:21.746 line:85%
Then I tested the samples in tiny ovens.

6
00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:28.023 line:85%
Because of that, scientists verified that water ice is hidden just under the surface.

7
00:00:28.113 --> 00:00:31.138 line:85%
I also found a chemical called perchlorate.

8
00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:34.607 line:85%
My mission ended in November 2008.

9
00:00:34.697 --> 00:00:37.608 line:85%
What would you look for in Martian ice?
